@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

actor "User" as User
participant "PaymentService" as PaymentService
participant "BankGateway" as BankGateway
participant "UserService" as UserService
participant "EmailService" as EmailService

== Process Payment with Return Values ==

User -> PaymentService : submits payment request
PaymentService -> PaymentService : validates payment data
PaymentService -> BankGateway : process payment
BankGateway --> PaymentService : returns payment result
PaymentService --> User : returns confirmation status
PaymentService ->> PaymentService : notifies "payment_processed"

== User Registration with Validation ==

User -> UserService : submits registration form
UserService -> UserService : validates user data
UserService -> EmailService : send verification
EmailService --> UserService : returns email status
UserService --> User : returns registration result

@enduml